# agent-skills + ui-ux-pro-max-skill were accidentally added as gitlinks
# (mode 160000) in earlier commits without a corresponding .gitmodules
# entry. That broke CI's submodule checkout step. Removed from the index
# in PR #39; ignored here so they don't sneak back in. If you want to
# track them for real, either:
#   - add as a regular directory: `git add -f <name>/`
#   - add as a proper submodule:  `git submodule add <url> <name>`
agent-skills/
ui-ux-pro-max-skill/

